      "writtenOn": "2022-07-01T17:46:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good question. They are the only two types handled at the moment as they were the source of most of the issues that arose due to inconsistencies between sdk and apex. They also affected the vast majority of the mainline modules.\n\nOther modules that may need to be automatically exported are compat config, java lib, shared lib, jni lib. They will be added as needed. However, most mainline modules don\u0027t yet export them so the benefits are smaller and at the moment is outweighed by the cost of adding them.",
